# Gym House — environment
#
# The demo runs on the MOCK data layer with NO environment variables at all.
# Everything below is only needed when you wire Supabase (i.e. after a client
# buys). See supabase/README.md for the step-by-step swap.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is git-ignored.

# --- Supabase project (required to go live) ---
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<ref>.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=sb_secret_...      # admin client in app code (RLS bypass)

# --- Management API only (migrations; NOT used by the app) ---
# Personal Access Token: Supabase dashboard -> Account -> Access Tokens
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=sbp_...

# --- Payments (Paystack, NGN) — only when taking real money ---
# Secret key stays server-side; never expose it to the client.
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
PUBLIC_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_...
